lishes at <a href="https://github.com/aixlehq/flow">https://github.com/aixlehq/flow</a> under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the “<strong>Open-Source Code</strong>”). The Open-Source Code is licensed solely under that license and is not part of the Services licensed under this Agreement, and nothing in this Agreement limits Client’s rights under that license with respect to the Open-Source Code. Except for the Open-Source Code, the Provider Platform (including all configurations, agent definitions, prompts, policies, templates, and other materials that Provider uses to provide the Services, but excluding Client Workflows (as defined in Section 4.1)) is proprietary to Provider, is not open-source software, constitutes Provider’s Confidential Information, and is made available to Client solely as part of the Services in accordance with this Agreement.</p>
