<p class="clause" id="section-1-6"><strong>1.6 Changes to the Services.</strong> Provider may modify the Services from time to time, including the artificial intelligence models, Third-Party Integrations (as defined in Section 2.9), and features that the Services support, provided that Provider will not materially reduce the core functionality of the Services during a fixed subscription term stated in an Order Form. Provider will use commercially reasonable efforts to notify Client in advance of any change that requires action by Client.</p>
